# 20. COMBINED RISK STORY

One of the strongest potential product stories is:

Traditional cybersecurity asks:

"Is this asset compromised?"

Our platform additionally asks:

"How dangerous is this asset to the city if its cryptographic protection becomes obsolete?"

And because the city is modeled as a graph:

"How far can that exposure matter across interconnected infrastructure?"

This produces:

CURRENT CYBER RISK
+
FUTURE QUANTUM EXPOSURE
+
GRAPH DEPENDENCY
=
QUANTUM-AWARE CITY CYBER RISK

