# 21. FINTECH STREAM RELEVANCE

The hackathon is being evaluated under a FinTech stream.

The PQC extension can strengthen this positioning.

Financial infrastructure in a smart city may include:

- payment gateways
- municipal payment systems
- tax systems
- banking integrations
- digital identity
- citizen wallets
- financial databases
- transaction APIs
- government disbursement systems

These systems contain high-value and potentially long-lived sensitive information.

A quantum-resilient cybersecurity platform can therefore help protect:

- financial transactions
- digital identities
- payment infrastructure
- financial records
- government financial systems
- citizen financial data

The project should not claim that every smart-city endpoint is a FinTech system.

